1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,616
Welcome to the build!

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,313
First, the adapter case.

3
00:00:05,513 --> 00:00:09,777
The workspace fills with parts: the
circuit board and the housing.

4
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:18,193
The board slots into place, with vents and
connectors lining up.

5
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:27,079
And the finished case comes together, lid
and all.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:32,986
Every board and standoff has its place.

7
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:38,931
Time to test it!

8
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:44,356
Out on track, our 3D-printed wheel rim
does the steering.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:55,125
And it works! RACELOGIC timing keeps score
as the laps come in.
